{"unit_id":"aomk20201110-commits__CST_AI#card-zh","repo":"aomk20201110-commits/CST_AI","commit":"437fba67677b4a7d652901c1dd55625b713f16f0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"CST_AI（DSH 插件，桌面端工具）：把 CST Studio Suite 的仿真任务包装为可计划、执行和恢复的工作流。它通过 DSH 工具适配器调用 Python 公共 API，支持先查看执行阶段与求解预算，再按任务规格运行。用户可查询持久化状态、检查结果和恢复未完成任务，也可处理参数扫描及结构化仿真结果。适合在 Windows 上使用 CST 的工程师；需要已安装 CST Studio Suite 2026、其 Python 环境及 PowerShell，DSH 适配器另需 Node.js。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-13","cst_ai_plugin/public.py:1-17"]}
{"unit_id":"aomk20201110-commits__CST_AI#card-en","repo":"aomk20201110-commits/CST_AI","commit":"437fba67677b4a7d652901c1dd55625b713f16f0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"CST_AI is a DSH plugin for planning, running, and resuming CST Studio Suite tasks. Its adapter previews stages and solve budgets, runs tasks, inspects saved results, and resumes interrupted work. It requires CST Studio Suite 2026, PowerShell, and Node.js on Windows.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-13","cst_ai_plugin/public.py:1-17"]}
